  ['Which foods support the skin barrier?', 'I start with sources of omega-3s, zinc, vitamin A, vitamin C and protein: fatty fish, eggs, seeds, citrus, berries, leafy greens and legumes. Part 2 of this series covers foods and supplements in detail.'],
];
